:: Passout alley
스스로를 너무 몰아붙였다.
<br><br>
<<passout>>

<<if dangerEvent()>>
	<<switch random(1, 3)>>
		<<case 3>>
			<<link [[일어난다|Abduction]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<<case 2>>
			<<link [[일어난다|Street Wake]]>><</link>>
		<<case 1>>
			<<link [[일어난다|Molestation alley]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</switch>>
<<else>>
		<<ambulance>>
<</if>>

<<pass 1 hour>>
<<trauma 6>><<set $stress -= 2000>>

